  "translation": "Today is the weekend. My family and I went to a supermarket together. There were many people in the supermarket. We first entered the fruit section, then went to the vegetable section. There were fresh tomatoes and cucumbers there. Mom asked what I wanted to eat. I said I wanted to eat fish. Dad said, 'Let's buy a piece of fish.' Later, we also bought bread and milk. I bought a cup of juice, and Mom also bought a cup of coffee. Coming out of the supermarket, we went to the park nearby. There were children playing in the park. My younger brother and I happily ran over. We had a lot of fun. We were all hungry. Then we went home to cook. The meal Mom cooked was very delicious."
